Z||000008||PBJ||11-06-2001||09:54 PM||||It sounds like you still have a gear problem. cause in 84-86 headlight mtrs used the stops that the arm hits which loads up the mtr and moves the mtr armature to remove power, so if it is still running your mtr is not "loading" up and turning off.  This is all internal switching within the mtr.||||reg||1
